sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant I as Input
  participant A as Agent Loop Plugin
  participant P as System Prompt Service
  participant S as Session Event Log
  participant L as LLM Service
  participant T as Tool Service
  participant D as Persistence

  rect rgb(238, 246, 255)
    Note over I,D: Turn 1 — one Input, three Steps
    I->>A: “Fix sum([]): expected 0, got undefined”
    A->>S: append turn/start

    Note over A,T: Step 1 — edit
    A->>P: assemble system prompt and Tool schemas
    A->>S: append step/start and admitted Input after pre-step
    S-->>A: derive model history
    A->>L: model request
    L-->>A: assistant output with edit Tool Call
    A->>S: append assistant output and tool/call
    A->>T: execute edit Tool
    T-->>A: edit result
    A->>S: append tool/result and step/end

    Note over A,T: Step 2 — verify
    A->>P: reassemble current prompt and Tools
    A->>S: append step/start after pre-step
    S-->>A: derive history including edit result
    A->>L: next model request
    L-->>A: assistant output with test Tool Call
    A->>T: execute test Tool
    T-->>A: tests passed
    A->>S: append call, result, and step/end

    Note over A,L: Step 3 — finish
    A->>S: append step/start
    S-->>A: derive history including test result
    A->>L: next model request
    L-->>A: final answer, no Tool Call
    A->>S: append assistant message, step/end, turn/end
  end

  S-->>D: write-behind / checkpoint contiguous events

  rect rgb(244, 250, 240)
    Note over I,S: Turn 2 — a later Input, same Session
    I->>A: “Why should empty input return 0?”
    A->>S: append turn/start
    A->>P: assemble current prompt and Tools
    A->>S: append step/start and admitted Input after pre-step
    S-->>A: derive history from Turn 1 + new Input
    A->>L: model request
    L-->>A: explanation, no Tool Call
    A->>S: append assistant message, step/end, turn/end
  end

  S-->>D: persist the extended Session history
